The ReSTIR story's rounds of spatial reuse
==========================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 4's beats `c4-rounds-tree` and `c4-rounds-reach`,
stage by stage as `roundsStage` goes from 0 to 4: the paper's tree of reservoirs, P's round-2 reservoir combining
k neighbours' round-1 reservoirs, each combining k pixels' own (k and the radius are the dock's `restirNeighbours`
and `restirRadius`); its count, k to the n times M; then, on a logarithmic scale, that count against the distinct
pixels the rounds reach with the lab's neighbour pattern (examples.rs `reach`), and the paper's rounds marked.

$[Import* std]$[Import* render_lab_runtime]$[Import* render_lab_math]$[Import* paper_restir_values]$[Import* paper_restir_natives]$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The example

The candidates each pixel draws (the paper's thirty-two), the rounds the plot runs to, and the seed of the
neighbours' rotations.
$[# _count 32]
$[# _rounds 9]
$[# _seed 5]
The size of the scene's formulas, and where the counts go.
$[# _size 0.44]
$[# _labelX 5.3]

The tree

Fn([Int], Graph). The paper's tree for two rounds: P, its k neighbours, and theirs, as dots.
$[# {_tree k}
    [# n {+ 1 {+ k {* k k}}}]
    [# nodes {map {range 0 n} {^ {i}
        {dotAt f"{node${str i}}" origin {!if {= i 0} 0.17 {!if {<= i k} 0.12 0.08}} {!if {= i 0} accentColor {!if {<= i k} estimateColor targetColor}}}}}]
    [# edges {append
        {map {range 1 {+ k 1}} {^ {i} {pair 0 i}}}
        {flatten {map {range 1 {+ k 1}} {^ {i} {map {range 0 k} {^ {j} {pair i {+ {+ k 1} {+ {* {- i 1} k} j}}}}}}}}}]
    {graph "tree" nodes edges "tree" {box {v2 -6.6 -2.2} {v2 3.2 2.6}} false textDimColor 0}]

Fn([Float, Int], List(Mob)). The tree at `t` (stage 0 to 2): the pixels' own reservoirs, round 1 combining k of
them into each neighbour's, round 2 combining those into P's, each level's count beside it; then the count for n
rounds, and every leaf lit (each a new neighbour).
$[# {_treeScene s k}
    [# g {_tree k}]
    [# at {.at g}]
    [# m _count]
    [# leaves {flatten {map {range {+ k 1} {+ 1 {+ k {* k k}}}} {^ {i} {nth {.nodes g} i}}}}]
    [# middle {flatten {map {range 1 {+ k 1}} {^ {i} {nth {.nodes g} i}}}}]
    [# root {nth {.nodes g} 0}]
    [# lowEdges {flatten {map {range k {* k {+ k 1}}} {^ {e} {nth {.edges g} e}}}}]
    [# highEdges {flatten {map {range 0 k} {^ {e} {nth {.edges g} e}}}}]
    [# yLeaf {.y {nth at {+ k 1}}}]
    [# yMid {.y {nth at 1}}]
    [# yRoot {.y {nth at 0}}]
    [# {_level id key latex y color t}
        {fadeIn t {append
            {moveTo {caption {++ id "Note"} key 0.3 textDimColor} {v2 _labelX {+ y 0.45}}}
            {moveTo {tex id latex _size color} {v2 _labelX y}}}}]
    [# leafCount {_level "leafM" {textKey "roundsmath-own"} f"{M = ${str m}}" yLeaf targetColor {phase s 0.0 0.2}}]
    [# midCount {_level "midM" {textKey "roundsmath-round1"} f"{k\,M = ${str {* k m}}}" yMid estimateColor {phase s 0.45 0.6}}]
    [# rootLabel {texParts "rootM" f"{k^{\lit{1}{2}} M = ${str {* {* k k} m}}}" _size accentColor {' "n"} {' accentColor}}]
    [# rootGeneral {texParts "rootM" f"{k^{\lit{1}{n}} M}" 0.56 accentColor {' "n"} {' accentColor}}]
    [# rootAt {v2 _labelX yRoot}]
    [# rootNote {moveTo {caption "rootNote" {textKey "roundsmath-round2"} 0.3 textDimColor} {v2 _labelX {+ yRoot 0.45}}}]
    [# rootCount {!if {< s 1.0}
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.85 1.0} {moveTo rootLabel rootAt}}
        {transform {phase s 1.0 1.4} {moveTo rootLabel rootAt} {moveTo rootGeneral rootAt}}}]
    [# newNote {fadeIn {phase s 1.5 1.8} {moveTo {caption "newNote" {textKey "roundsmath-paths"} 0.32 targetColor} {v2 -1.7 -2.75}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.0 0.2} leaves}
        leafCount
        {create {phase s 0.15 0.45} lowEdges}
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.3 0.45} middle}
        midCount
        {create {phase s 0.55 0.8} highEdges}
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.7 0.85} root}
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.75 0.9} rootNote}
        rootCount
        {!if {!and {> s 1.4} {< s 2.0}} {pointParts {phase s 1.4 1.9} leaves {map leaves idOf} targetColor} {'}}
        {!if {< s 1.5} {'} newNote}}}]

The reach

Fn([Float, Int, Float], List(Mob)). The count against the pixels reached at `s` (stage 2 to 4), on a logarithmic
scale: k to the n times M for each number of rounds, the distinct pixels the rounds end on times M below it, and
the paper's rounds marked.
$[# {_reachScene s k radius}
    [# reach {exampleReach k radius _rounds _seed}]
    [# m {float _count}]
    [# ax {axesIn {box {v2 -5.4 -2.3} {v2 2.2 2.6}} {axisRange 0.0 {float _rounds} 1.0} {axisRange 1.0 8.0 1.0}}]
    [# {_log x} {/ {ln x} {ln 10.0}}]
    [# paths {map reach {^ {r} {onAxes ax {float {.n r}} {_log {* {.paths r} m}}}}}]
    [# pixels {map reach {^ {r} {onAxes ax {float {.n r}} {_log {* {float {.pixels r}} m}}}}}]
    [# yLabels {flatten {map {range 1 9} {^ {i} {moveTo {tex f"{yl${str i}}" f"{10^{${str i}}}" 0.42 textDimColor} {add2 {onAxes ax 0.0 {float i}} {v2 -0.6 0.0}}}}}}]
    [# axes {flatten {'
        {axesFigure "axes" ax textDimColor 0.34 true false}
        yLabels
        {moveTo {caption "axisN" {textKey "roundsmath-rounds"} 0.3 textDimColor} {add2 {onAxes ax {/ {float _rounds} 2.0} 1.0} {v2 0.0 -0.85}}}}}]
    [# {_series id points color}
        {append
            {pathThrough id points color 3.0}
            {flatten {map {range 0 {length points}} {^ {i} {dotAt {++ id {str i}} {nth points i} 0.07 color}}}}}]
    [# {_end id key points color dy}
        {moveTo {caption id key 0.3 color} {add2 {nth points {- {length points} 1}} {v2 2.5 dy}}}]
    [# {_mark id key n dx}
        {append
            {dashedLine {++ id "Line"} {onAxes ax n 1.0} {onAxes ax n 8.0} accentColor 2.0}
            {moveTo {caption id key 0.3 accentColor} {add2 {onAxes ax n 8.0} {v2 dx 0.65}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fadeIn {phase s 2.1 2.3} axes}
        {create {phase s 2.25 2.55} {_series "paths" paths targetColor}}
        {!if {< s 2.3} {'} {fadeIn {phase s 2.3 2.5} {_end "pathsNote" {textKey "roundsmath-paths"} paths targetColor 0.0}}}
        {!if {< s 2.5} {'} {create {phase s 2.5 2.85} {_series "pixels" pixels totalColor}}}
        {!if {< s 2.75} {'} {fadeIn {phase s 2.75 2.95} {_end "pixelsNote" {textKey "roundsmath-pixels"} pixels totalColor 0.0}}}
        {!if {< s 3.0} {'} {fadeIn {phase s 3.0 3.3} {_mark "biased" {textKey "roundsmath-biased"} 2.0 1.0}}}
        {!if {< s 3.5} {'} {fadeIn {phase s 3.5 3.8} {_mark "unbiased" {textKey "roundsmath-unbiased"} 1.0 -0.7}}}}}]

The scene

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The scene at stage s.
$[# {_scene s}
    [# k {restirNeighbours}]
    {!if {< s 2.0} {_treeScene s k} {_reachScene s k {float {restirRadius}}}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The rounds of spatial reuse at stage `roundsStage`.
$[# roundsMath {: {^ {t} {_scene {roundsStage}}} Math}]
